    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.34.0"&gt;3.34.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracing] Fix missing traces when using .NET Core 2.1 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3734623508" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7955" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7955/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7955"&gt;#7955&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracing] Don't inject into EventBridge when injection is disabled (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3707937531" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7919" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7919/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7919"&gt;#7919&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracing] Bug fix for missing traces with some HotChocolate and Grpc integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tracer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Don't use global statics where possible (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3714986602" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7939" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7939/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7939"&gt;#7939&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Don't use &lt;code&gt;System.Runtime.CompilerServices.Unsafe&lt;/code&gt; in .NET Core 2.1 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3734623508" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7955" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7955/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7955"&gt;#7955&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Continuous Profiler&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[profiler] Refactor linux unwinder and remove unused one (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3706911713" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7917" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7917/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7917"&gt;#7917&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix &lt;code&gt;System.InvalidCastException&lt;/code&gt; in Grpc during Header Removal (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3743770408" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7975" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7975/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7975"&gt;#7975&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix HotChocolate duck typing error (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3711448822" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7930" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7930/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7930"&gt;#7930&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restore null scope check to stop EventBridge injection (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3707937531" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7919" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7919/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7919"&gt;#7919&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fix(DSM): Fix race condition on DataStreamsWriter disposal (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3740274338" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7968" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7968/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7968"&gt;#7968&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Miscellaneous&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler/Tracer] Bump to libdatadog v24.0.2 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3452712090" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7560" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7560/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7560"&gt;#7560&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;bump libdatadog version to v25 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3742273777" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7971" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7971/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7971"&gt;#7971&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Downgrade DSM flush shutdown log from Error to Warning (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3748546500" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7984" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7984/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7984"&gt;#7984&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fix bug where process tags were never initialized for telemetry (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3734138596" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7954" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7954/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7954"&gt;#7954&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Build / Test&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add some documentation on updating Windows GitLab image for CI (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3591362117" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7782" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7782/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7782"&gt;#7782&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Package Versions Bump] Updating package versions (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3716006675" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7942" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7942/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7942"&gt;#7942&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update microbenchmarks to enable standard BP PR comments (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3731466762" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7952" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7952/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7952"&gt;#7952&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pre-cache reference assemblies as package references in analyzers tests (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3738641498" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7959" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7959/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7959"&gt;#7959&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add PR-level performance quality gates (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3739823624" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7967" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7967/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7967"&gt;#7967&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Github] Add permission for the apm-sdks-benchmarks repo (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3743137381" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7972" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7972/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7972"&gt;#7972&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix sealed analyzer, and fix regressions (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3743238630" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7973" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7973/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7973"&gt;#7973&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump memory limit slightly (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3746873334" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7977" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7977/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7977"&gt;#7977&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Package Versions Bump] Updating package versions (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3748124162" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7983" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7983/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7983"&gt;#7983&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/compare/v3.33.0...v3.34.0"&gt;Changes since 3.33.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
